## [Theme Revamp]($section.id("2026-10-10T00:00:00"))
The Retheme has been Rethemed, with the "iconic" blue space background, as well as some updated colors.
I've also added a new logo, and little version of me chilling at the top of the site.
On that line, the first of (hopefully many) secrets has been added.

## [Actual Developments]($section.id("2026-10-07T00:00:00"))
I actually did stuff to the website! It is no longer default, and has been rethemed.
I've also added an actual homepage and a blog post.

## [Hello Zine]($section.id("2026-10-05T00:00:00"))
